{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:BuchbergerAndPbw.JetStratifiedReduction","@type":"LeanModule","name":"BuchbergerAndPbw.JetStratifiedReduction","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Nat.Basic"],"declarations":5,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:UGB.GrobnerShirshov.ContentBlock.spoly_stratified_lt_naive_su2","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"UGB.GrobnerShirshov.ContentBlock.spoly_stratified_lt_naive_su2","kind":"theorem","line":71,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/unital-groebner-bases/buchberger-and-pbw/jet-stratified-reduction.lean#L71-L76","doc":"Jet stratification strictly skips work whenever there are ≥ 2\ndescended rules: at the SU(2) level it skips one descended×descended\npair (`spolyCountStratified 2 2 = 5 < 6 = spolyCountNaive 2 2`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:UGB.GrobnerShirshov.ContentBlock.spoly_count_decomposition_su2","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"UGB.GrobnerShirshov.ContentBlock.spoly_count_decomposition_su2","kind":"theorem","line":61,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/unital-groebner-bases/buchberger-and-pbw/jet-stratified-reduction.lean#L61-L69","doc":"The three counts partition the naive pair count: the stratified\nwork plus the skipped descended×descended pairs recover the naive\ntotal, `binom(m+k,2) = m·k + binom(k,2) + binom(m,2)`. Checked\nhere at the SU(2) Hecke level (`m = 2` descended Hecke/far-comm\nrules, `k = 2` transient rules), the standalone-verifiable\ninstance of the headline `O(m²) → O(mk + k²)` savings. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:UGB.GrobnerShirshov.ContentBlock.spolySavings","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"UGB.GrobnerShirshov.ContentBlock.spolySavings","kind":"def","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/unital-groebner-bases/buchberger-and-pbw/jet-stratified-reduction.lean#L57-L59","doc":"Pairs skipped by jet stratification: `m choose 2 ≈ O(m²)`.\nFaithful to `UGB.GrobnerShirshov.spolySavings`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:UGB.GrobnerShirshov.ContentBlock.spolyCountStratified","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"UGB.GrobnerShirshov.ContentBlock.spolyCountStratified","kind":"def","line":53,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/unital-groebner-bases/buchberger-and-pbw/jet-stratified-reduction.lean#L53-L55","doc":"Jet-stratified S-polynomial count: `m·k + k choose 2 ≈ O(mk + k²)`\npairs. Faithful to `UGB.GrobnerShirshov.spolyCountStratified`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:UGB.GrobnerShirshov.ContentBlock.spolyCountNaive","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"UGB.GrobnerShirshov.ContentBlock.spolyCountNaive","kind":"def","line":46,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/unital-groebner-bases/buchberger-and-pbw/jet-stratified-reduction.lean#L46-L51","doc":"**S-polynomial count** at level `n+1` under jet stratification.\n\nLet `m = |Σₙ|` (descended rules) and `k = |Σ^trans|` (transient).\nNaive Buchberger checks `(m + k) choose 2 ≈ O((m+k)²)` pairs.\nFaithful to `UGB.GrobnerShirshov.spolyCountNaive`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}